            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A light emitting device is provided. The light emitting device includes a substrate; a first light shielding layer disposed on the substrate and defining a plurality of first openings; a light filter layer overlapped with one of the plurality of first openings; a plurality of light emitting diodes disposed corresponding to the plurality of first openings; and a material layer. The first light shielding layer and the plurality of light emitting diodes are disposed on opposite sides of the material layer. The material layer includes silicon oxide material or oxygen-containing material.</p>
            </abstract>
